WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.040
- Joe Rogan threatens to
sue CNN for defamation

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.720
on their claims that he
was taking horse dewormer.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.590
Well, not exactly, he was
just simply grousing about

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.240
what he claimed was unfair
reporting by Jim Acosta,

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.090
claiming that Joe Rogan
had taken horse dewormer.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:14.923
It is in fact true

00:00:14.923 --> 00:00:16.640
that Joe Rogan took Ivermectin

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.660
after he contracted COVID-19,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.550
but he got a prescription from his doctor

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.830
and took the human variation of the drug.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.260
Now, it doesn't actually
look like he's gonna sue,

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.430
but let's assume that he was,

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.650
would he have a case for defamation?

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:27.530
Well, probably not.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:28.570
First of all, as a celebrity

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.630
he'd have a very hard time
against Acosta and CNN,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.690
because he'd be subject to
the actual malice standard,

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.740
which requires basically
that Jim Acosta know

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.100
that what he was saying was false.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.070
On top of that, Acosta cost of might have

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.160
the defense of substantial truth,

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.970
because Ivermectin in
variations is used for

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:42.820
both horses and people.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:44.000
And then of course, there is the defense

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.930
of hyperbole and opinion, your
opinion on revealed facts,

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.340
because Acosta was
intending to insult Rogan,

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.390
because Rogan like an idiot
refused to get vaccinated

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.000
so he had to get treatment after the fact

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.210
for his COVID infection.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.890
So was it sloppy reporting? Yes.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:57.210
Is it defamatory? No.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.887
Are we going to see these
people in court? Sadly not.

